WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.107 --> 00:00:02.657
LIAISON TO ITS STAFF.

00:00:02.658 --> 00:00:04.903
THAT’S A LOOK AT YOUR HEADLINES

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.159
SEND IT BACK TO YOU.

00:00:07.193 --> 00:00:08.523
RACHEL: THANK YOU, JILLIAN.

00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:10.103
BORDER MAYOR BLAMING THE BIDEN

00:00:10.137 --> 00:00:13.193
ADMINISTRATION FOR SENDING

00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:16.551
MIGRANTS TO HIS TOWN BY BUS.

00:00:16.586 --> 00:00:18.585
GILA BEND ARIZONA HALF WAY

00:00:18.587 --> 00:00:20.248
BETWEEN MEXICO AND PHOENIX AND

00:00:20.282 --> 00:00:20.984
2,000 RESIDENTS.

00:00:20.985 --> 00:00:22.360
MAYOR CHRIS RIGS JOINS ME NOW.

00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:23.425
WELCOME, MAYOR.

00:00:23.459 --> 00:00:24.622
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:25.837
RACHEL: TELL ME EXACTLY WHAT’S

00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:26.228
HAPPENING?

00:00:26.229 --> 00:00:29.076
THEY COME INTO YOUR TOWN ON BUS?

00:00:29.077 --> 00:00:32.039
AND THEY DROP THEM OFF WHERE?

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.383
&gt;&gt; WELL, RACHEL, WHAT THEY DO IS

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:37.287
EITHER BRING THEM BY BUS, BY

00:00:37.321 --> 00:00:38.937
VAN, OR EVEN BY THEIR FILL

00:00:38.939 --> 00:00:39.345
TRUCKS.

00:00:39.347 --> 00:00:41.373
AND THEY BRING THEM TO ONE OF

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:42.610
OUR COMMUNITY PARKS AND WE

00:00:42.645 --> 00:00:44.431
REALLY DON’T HAVE A LOT OF PARKS

00:00:44.466 --> 00:00:46.043
BUT WE HAVE ONE CENTRALIZED PARK

00:00:46.077 --> 00:00:47.227
WHERE THEY BRING THEM.

00:00:47.261 --> 00:00:49.570
AND THEY DROP THEM OFF THERE,

00:00:49.604 --> 00:00:50.522
AND THEN THEY LEAF.

00:00:50.556 --> 00:00:51.698
RACHEL: DO YOU KNOW ANYTHING?

00:00:51.732 --> 00:00:53.035
DOES THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT TELL

00:00:53.036 --> 00:00:54.247
YOU ANYTHING ABOUT THEM, WHAT

00:00:54.282 --> 00:00:55.152
THEIR NAMES ARE?

00:00:55.186 --> 00:00:57.307
DO THEY HAVE A CRIMINAL HISTORY?

00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:58.411
HAVE THEY HAD COVID TESTS?

00:00:58.446 --> 00:00:58.682
ANYTHING?

00:00:58.716 --> 00:01:01.047
&gt;&gt; THEY WILL TELL US THEY

00:01:01.081 --> 00:01:03.881
HAVEN’T HAD A COVID TEST BECAUSE

00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:05.562
THEY DON’T DO THAT AT THE

00:01:05.563 --> 00:01:05.971
FACILITY.

00:01:05.973 --> 00:01:08.396
BUT, OTHER THAN THAT, THEY ARE

00:01:08.397 --> 00:01:09.326
GIVING US NOTHING.

00:01:09.327 --> 00:01:10.781
ABSOLUTELY NOTHING.

00:01:10.815 --> 00:01:13.266
AND WE HAVE ASKED, REPEATEDLY,

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.452
FOR DOCUMENTATION ON WHO THESE

00:01:15.453 --> 00:01:17.970
PEOPLE ARE, WHERE THEY ARE FROM,

00:01:18.005 --> 00:01:19.878
IF THEY DO HAVE A CRIMINAL

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.405
HISTORY, THEY WILL SOMETIMES

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:23.125
TELL US WELL, THEY DON’T CHECK

00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:24.543
FOR IN THE UNITED STATES AND

00:01:24.577 --> 00:01:25.923
THAT REALLY IS NOT WHAT I’M

00:01:25.924 --> 00:01:26.559
CONCERNED ABOUT.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:30.687
I’M MORE CONCERNED ABOUT THEIR

00:01:30.722 --> 00:01:32.231
COUNTRY OF ORIGIN.

00:01:32.266 --> 00:01:33.947
RACHEL: THIS IS TRULY

00:01:33.948 --> 00:01:34.263
OUTRAGEOUS?

00:01:34.297 --> 00:01:35.303
HAS THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT

00:01:35.337 --> 00:01:36.021
OFFERED HELP?

00:01:36.055 --> 00:01:39.174
YOU ARE A TOWN OF 2,000?

00:01:39.176 --> 00:01:41.971
HOW IS THIS STRAKES RESOURCES IN

00:01:41.973 --> 00:01:43.304
STRANGE THE RESOURCES IN YOUR

00:01:43.305 --> 00:01:43.688
TOWN?

00:01:43.689 --> 00:01:45.456
&gt;&gt; THEY HAVE OFFERED NO HELP.

00:01:45.457 --> 00:01:47.069
LAST NIGHT I LITERALLY HAD TO

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.530
DECLARE A STATE OF EMERGENCY.

00:01:48.565 --> 00:01:50.590
I DID IT THROUGH MY COUNCIL SO

00:01:50.591 --> 00:01:51.594
IT WAS VERY OBVIOUS.

00:01:51.628 --> 00:01:54.584
I WASN’T TRYING TO BE POLITICAL

00:01:54.618 --> 00:01:55.699
ABOUT IT.

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:58.421
THAT THIS IS BEYOND WHAT WE ARE

00:01:58.455 --> 00:02:00.297
CAPABLE OF DOING AS A COMMUNITY

00:02:00.331 --> 00:02:01.487
OF ABOUT 2,000 PEOPLE.

00:02:01.489 --> 00:02:06.749
WE JUST SIMPLY CAN’T DO IT.

00:02:06.784 --> 00:02:09.536
WE CAN’T AFFORD TO CONTINUE TO

00:02:09.538 --> 00:02:11.097
RECEIVE THESE PEOPLE AND GET

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.675
THEM TO PLACES WHERE THEY WILL

00:02:12.709 --> 00:02:14.004
BE SAFE AND PROTECTED.

00:02:14.039 --> 00:02:15.337
WE LITERALLY HAVE NOTHING HERE

00:02:15.371 --> 00:02:16.638
FOR THEM.

00:02:16.672 --> 00:02:19.512
WE HAVE NO HOUSING.

00:02:19.546 --> 00:02:21.844
WE HAVE VERY LIMITED FOOD,

00:02:21.879 --> 00:02:23.033
ADDITIONAL FOOD AND OTHER

00:02:23.034 --> 00:02:24.053
RESOURCES.

00:02:24.088 --> 00:02:29.342
&gt;&gt; SO I REALLY DON’T UNDERSTAND

00:02:29.376 --> 00:02:32.414
WHY WE WERE EVEN SELECTED FOR

00:02:32.415 --> 00:02:33.157
THESE DROPS.

00:02:33.192 --> 00:02:34.806
RACHEL: YOU HAVE HAD NO RESPONSE

00:02:34.841 --> 00:02:35.573
FROM THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT.

00:02:35.575 --> 00:02:36.555
HAVE YOU REACHED OUT TO THE

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.297
BIDEN ADMINISTRATION.

00:02:37.299 --> 00:02:40.129
YOU REACHED OUT TO YOUR

00:02:40.163 --> 00:02:40.909
CONGRESSIONAL REPRESENTATIVE.

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:41.305
NOTHING?

00:02:41.306 --> 00:02:42.545
&gt;&gt; I’M GETTING NOTHING.

00:02:42.547 --> 00:02:46.082
THE ONLY PEOPLE THAT SEEM TO BE

00:02:46.083 --> 00:02:49.150
WILLING TO HELP ARE A FEW OF OUR

00:02:49.184 --> 00:02:50.212
STATE REPRESENTATIVES.

00:02:50.213 --> 00:02:51.791
I HAVE HAD ASSISTANCE FROM

00:02:51.825 --> 00:02:53.373
SENATOR SINEMA.

00:02:53.374 --> 00:02:56.231
I HAVE HAD ASSISTANCE FROM

00:02:56.232 --> 00:03:02.784
CONGRESS BIGGS, AND I HAVE HAD
ASSISTANCE FROM ARIZONA

00:03:02.785 --> 00:03:04.048
ASSISTANCE FROM ARIZONA

00:03:04.049 --> 00:03:09.104
REPRESENTATIVE I UNDERSTAND THEY

00:03:09.105 --> 00:03:14.088
ARE TALKING TO OTHER NARROWS IN

00:03:14.089 --> 00:03:19.142
LARGE CITIES GOOD EXAMPLE WOULD

00:03:19.144 --> 00:03:23.021
BE THE CITY OF MESA,.

