&gt;&gt; Maria: ON CNN.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.144
RACHEL: REALLY QUICKLY HAS THE

00:03:26.178 --> 00:03:27.862
CRIME RATE CHANGED AT ALL SINCE

