&gt;&gt; WE HAVE SEEN UPTICK IN CRIME.

00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:32.795
RACHEL: THANK YOU MAYOR RIGS, WE

00:03:32.797 --> 00:03:33.767
APPRECIATE YOU JOINING US ON THE

00:03:33.769 --> 00:03:34.148
SHOW.

00:03:34.183 --> 00:03:35.605
THIS IS REALLY JUST UNBELIEVABLE

00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:36.080
STORY.

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:37.419
WE WONDER WHERE ELSE IT’S

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:37.657
